{"id":"ai-study-partner","title":"AI: using AI to learn, not to cheat","subject":"AI prompting","label":"AI prompting","exams":[],"language":"en","seconds":153,"duration":152.83,"audio":"voice.mp3","words":446,"sections":[{"id":"hook","title":"Stuck on homework","start":0,"end":14.695},{"id":"explain","title":"The Aim","start":14.695,"end":35.205},{"id":"explain2","title":"Good Uses","start":35.205,"end":65.065},{"id":"example","title":"Worked Prompt","start":65.065,"end":88.125},{"id":"check","title":"Quick Check","start":88.125,"end":99.395},{"id":"answer","title":"The Answer","start":99.395,"end":107.125},{"id":"mistakes","title":"Common Mistakes","start":107.125,"end":133.075},{"id":"recap","title":"Recap","start":133.075,"end":152.83}],"lines":[{"s":0,"a":0.5,"b":5.97,"text":"Your homework is due tomorrow, and you're stuck. So you ask AI, and it gives you the answer.","w":[0.52,0.74,1.16,1.28,1.48,2.22,2.32,2.5,3.32,3.48,3.72,4.06,4.92,5.04,5.14,5.36,5.48,5.66]},{"s":0,"a":6.27,"b":8.74,"text":"Feels good, right? But here's the question.","w":[6.34,6.68,6.98,7.84,7.98,8.2,8.3]},{"s":0,"a":9.04,"b":14.27,"text":"If AI does the thinking, what have you actually learned? I'm Kora. Let's find out.","w":[9.12,9.42,9.82,10.06,10.18,11,11.18,11.32,11.5,11.86,12.7,12.88,13.6,13.82,14.12]},{"s":1,"a":15.12,"b":16.68,"text":"The aim of studying is simple.","w":[15.14,15.34,15.54,15.64,16.2,16.34]},{"s":1,"a":16.98,"b":21.51,"text":"You want to be able to do it alone, in the exam hall or at work, with no help.","w":[17.04,17.2,17.4,17.5,17.64,17.84,17.96,18.12,18.24,18.96,19.04,19.18,19.56,19.92,20.08,20.16,20.74,21,21.2]},{"s":1,"a":21.81,"b":24.91,"text":"If the AI does the thinking, you learn nothing.","w":[21.88,22,22.26,22.74,23.02,23.18,24.02,24.22,24.54]},{"s":1,"a":25.21,"b":30.99,"text":"Research on learning shows two things build memory: testing yourself, and explaining ideas in your own words.","w":[25.24,25.82,25.96,26.32,26.66,26.88,27.2,27.46,28.36,28.7,29.16,29.26,29.74,30.12,30.22,30.4,30.56]},{"s":1,"a":31.29,"b":34.78,"text":"So use AI to make you think harder, not to think for you.","w":[31.34,31.62,31.96,32.32,32.46,32.62,32.74,32.98,33.82,34.02,34.14,34.36,34.5]},{"s":2,"a":35.63,"b":36.67,"text":"Here's what that looks like.","w":[35.64,35.88,36.02,36.18,36.38]},{"s":2,"a":36.97,"b":41.3,"text":"Ask for an explanation at your level, then a simpler one with an everyday example.","w":[37.08,37.32,37.46,37.56,38.22,38.32,38.5,39.28,39.46,39.58,40.06,40.22,40.38,40.52,40.9]},{"s":2,"a":41.6,"b":46.08,"text":"Ask it to quiz you one question at a time, and wait for your answer before marking it.","w":[41.72,41.94,42.04,42.18,42.44,42.68,42.88,43.3,43.4,43.48,44.24,44.4,44.64,44.78,45,45.3,45.62,45.98]},{"s":2,"a":46.38,"b":49.42,"text":"When you're stuck, ask for a hint, not the answer.","w":[46.4,46.56,46.78,47.56,47.8,47.96,48.04,48.72,48.92,49.08]},{"s":2,"a":49.72,"b":54.28,"text":"Explain a topic to it in your own words, and ask what you got wrong or left out.","w":[49.78,50.26,50.34,50.72,50.9,51.06,51.14,51.36,51.54,52.32,52.58,52.8,52.94,53.08,53.26,53.64,53.76,54.06]},{"s":2,"a":54.58,"b":57.42,"text":"Ask for practice questions like the ones in your syllabus.","w":[54.72,54.94,55.12,55.54,56.02,56.22,56.4,56.6,56.68,56.84]},{"s":2,"a":57.72,"b":62.01,"text":"Ask for feedback on an essay you wrote yourself, without it rewriting the essay.","w":[57.84,58.08,58.26,58.78,58.88,59.04,59.34,59.48,59.7,60.54,60.92,61.04,61.5,61.66]},{"s":2,"a":62.31,"b":64.64,"text":"And ask it to help you make a revision plan.","w":[62.34,62.64,62.86,62.96,63.08,63.3,63.5,63.72,63.8,64.26]},{"s":3,"a":65.49,"b":66.87,"text":"Let's try a real prompt.","w":[65.52,65.78,66.06,66.16,66.42]},{"s":3,"a":67.17,"b":69.76,"text":"Say you're learning the mole concept in chemistry.","w":[67.28,67.48,67.7,68.04,68.18,68.48,69.06,69.2]},{"s":3,"a":70.06,"b":72.94,"text":"You could type: I am learning the mole concept.","w":[70.08,70.24,70.42,71.26,71.4,71.54,71.88,72.02,72.34]},{"s":3,"a":73.24,"b":77.36,"text":"Ask me five questions, one at a time, from easy to hard.","w":[73.36,73.6,73.82,74.16,75.2,75.34,75.44,75.52,76.24,76.6,76.94,77.1]},{"s":3,"a":77.66,"b":81.77,"text":"After each answer, tell me if I am right and explain briefly.","w":[77.78,78.12,78.46,79.32,79.54,79.68,79.8,79.9,80,80.72,80.86,81.34]},{"s":3,"a":82.07,"b":83.96,"text":"Do not give the answer before I try.","w":[82.08,82.28,82.54,82.72,82.9,83.2,83.52,83.62]},{"s":3,"a":84.26,"b":87.7,"text":"Notice what that prompt does. It keeps the thinking with you.","w":[84.36,84.72,84.88,85.08,85.4,86.38,86.52,86.84,86.98,87.32,87.46]},{"s":4,"a":88.55,"b":89.18,"text":"Quick check.","w":[88.6,88.86]},{"s":4,"a":89.48,"b":93.21,"text":"You're stuck on a homework problem. Which request helps you learn more?","w":[89.52,89.78,90.16,90.28,90.36,90.72,91.58,91.82,92.28,92.52,92.66,92.92]},{"s":4,"a":93.66,"b":96.69,"text":"Give me the answer, or give me a hint for the first step.","w":[93.68,93.88,94,94.2,95.04,95.18,95.4,95.56,95.66,95.94,96.06,96.18,96.42]},{"s":4,"a":96.99,"b":98.97,"text":"Pause here and try it. I'll wait.","w":[97.04,97.36,97.58,97.68,97.94,98.42,98.62]},{"s":5,"a":99.82,"b":100.39,"text":"The hint.","w":[99.84,100]},{"s":5,"a":100.69,"b":103.9,"text":"A hint keeps you doing the thinking, so the idea sticks.","w":[100.74,100.84,101.16,101.38,101.5,101.72,101.82,102.68,102.86,103.04,103.42]},{"s":5,"a":104.2,"b":106.7,"text":"The answer just moves the thinking to the AI.","w":[104.24,104.46,104.76,105.02,105.36,105.48,105.86,105.98,106.2]},{"s":6,"a":107.55,"b":108.78,"text":"Three mistakes to avoid.","w":[107.58,107.82,108.24,108.38]},{"s":6,"a":109.08,"b":113.05,"text":"One, copying answers, or reading explanations without testing yourself.","w":[109.32,109.98,110.5,110.92,111.08,111.4,112.04,112.32,112.66]},{"s":6,"a":113.35,"b":117.55,"text":"Two, believing a wrong explanation. Check facts against your textbook.","w":[113.38,114.12,114.6,114.7,114.98,116.06,116.32,116.62,116.88,117.04]},{"s":6,"a":117.85,"b":121.96,"text":"Three, using AI the night before instead of practising over weeks.","w":[117.92,118.72,119.1,119.48,119.62,119.8,120.34,120.64,120.76,121.32,121.54]},{"s":6,"a":122.26,"b":127.01,"text":"And remember, handing in AI writing as your own is cheating, and you can be caught.","w":[122.32,122.46,123.22,123.62,124.08,124.52,124.86,124.96,125.18,125.36,125.48,126.24,126.36,126.5,126.62,126.76]},{"s":6,"a":127.31,"b":132.65,"text":"Follow your school's rules, say when you used AI, and never paste personal information.","w":[127.34,127.66,127.82,128.18,129,129.18,129.34,129.58,129.94,130.88,131.02,131.32,131.68,132.1]},{"s":7,"a":133.5,"b":134.7,"text":"Three things to remember.","w":[133.52,133.82,134.14,134.28]},{"s":7,"a":135,"b":137.77,"text":"Use AI to make you think, not to think for you.","w":[135.12,135.42,135.8,135.94,136.12,136.28,136.9,137.12,137.24,137.46,137.6]},{"s":7,"a":138.07,"b":141.27,"text":"Ask for hints, quizzes and feedback on your own work.","w":[138.22,138.46,138.62,139.32,139.82,140,140.5,140.58,140.76,140.94]},{"s":7,"a":141.57,"b":145.39,"text":"Check facts, follow the rules, and protect your personal information.","w":[141.62,141.9,142.62,142.94,143.06,143.78,143.88,144.24,144.4,144.84]},{"s":7,"a":145.69,"b":149.21,"text":"Top tip: the best prompt is one that ends with you doing the work.","w":[145.7,145.98,146.5,146.66,146.98,147.4,147.6,147.74,147.96,148.14,148.3,148.52,148.78,148.9]},{"s":7,"a":149.51,"b":152.23,"text":"Knowzone is here whenever you're ready to practise.","w":[149.6,150.14,150.26,150.84,151.2,151.38,151.6,151.72]}],"scenes":[{"at":0.25,"heading":"Stuck on homework","items":[{"at":0.4,"kind":"text","text":"Homework due tomorrow; stuck; ask AI → answer"},{"at":6.17,"kind":"text","text":"If AI does the thinking, what have you learned?"}]},{"at":14.87,"heading":"The Aim","items":[{"at":16.88,"kind":"text","text":"Aim: do it alone—exam hall or work, no help"},{"at":21.71,"kind":"text","text":"If AI does the thinking, you learn nothing"},{"at":25.11,"kind":"term","text":"Memory builders","detail":"Testing yourself; explaining ideas in your own words"},{"at":31.19,"kind":"text","text":"Use AI to think harder, not to think for you"}]},{"at":35.38,"heading":"Good Uses","items":[{"at":36.87,"kind":"text","text":"Explanation at your level; then simpler + everyday example"},{"at":41.5,"kind":"text","text":"Quiz me 1 question at a time; wait before marking"},{"at":46.28,"kind":"text","text":"When stuck: ask for a hint, not the answer"},{"at":49.62,"kind":"text","text":"Explain topic in own words; ask what you missed"}]},{"at":54.33,"heading":"Good Uses: Practice","items":[{"at":54.48,"kind":"text","text":"Ask for practice questions like your syllabus"},{"at":57.62,"kind":"text","text":"Feedback on your own essay; no rewriting"},{"at":62.21,"kind":"text","text":"Help make a revision plan"}]},{"at":65.24,"heading":"Worked Prompt","items":[{"at":69.96,"kind":"text","text":"Prompt: I am learning the mole concept."},{"at":73.14,"kind":"text","text":"Ask 5 questions, 1 at a time, easy → hard"},{"at":77.56,"kind":"text","text":"After each answer: right? explain briefly"},{"at":81.97,"kind":"text","text":"Do not give the answer before I try"},{"at":84.16,"kind":"text","text":"Keeps the thinking with you"}]},{"at":88.13,"heading":"Quick Check","items":[{"at":88.13,"kind":"question","text":"You're stuck on a homework problem. Which request helps you learn more: give me the answer, or give me a hint for the first step?"}]},{"at":99.57,"heading":"The Answer","items":[{"at":99.72,"kind":"text","text":"The hint."},{"at":100.59,"kind":"text","text":"Hint keeps you thinking → idea sticks."},{"at":104.1,"kind":"text","text":"Answer moves thinking to AI."}]},{"at":107.3,"heading":"Common Mistakes","items":[{"at":108.98,"kind":"wrong","text":"Copying answers; reading without self-testing"},{"at":113.25,"kind":"wrong","text":"Believing a wrong explanation"},{"at":117.75,"kind":"wrong","text":"Using AI only the night before"},{"at":122.16,"kind":"text","text":"AI writing as your own = cheating; can be caught"},{"at":127.21,"kind":"text","text":"Follow school rules; say when you used AI; no personal info"}]},{"at":133.25,"heading":"Recap","items":[{"at":134.9,"kind":"text","text":"Use AI to make you think, not to think for you"},{"at":137.97,"kind":"text","text":"Ask for hints, quizzes, feedback on your own work"},{"at":141.47,"kind":"text","text":"Check facts; follow rules; protect personal information"},{"at":145.59,"kind":"tip","text":"Best prompt ends with you doing the work"},{"at":149.41,"kind":"text","text":"Knowzone: practise when ready"}]}],"check":{"at":99.22,"seconds":10,"question":"You're stuck on a homework problem. Which request helps you learn more: give me the answer, or give me a hint for the first step?","answer":"The hint: it keeps you doing the thinking, so the idea sticks."},"fps":30,"mouth":"","level":"","credits":[],"voice":"qwen3-tts-12hz-1.7b (cloned voice)"}